Package: panelSCM
Title: What the Package Does (One Line, Title Case)
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: 
    person("First", "Last", , "first.last@example.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Implements a panel-data extension of the Synthetic Control
    Method to estimate heterogeneous treatment effects. The approach
    constructs unit-specific synthetic controls, aligns individual
    treatment effects on a relative time scale, and estimates
    heterogeneous average treatment effects using kernel density
    estimation and highest density regions. The methodology is described
    in Baumert and Harmening (forthcoming).
